---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import HeroBanner from '../components/HeroBanner.astro';
import RequirementsClusterNav from '../components/RequirementsClusterNav.astro';

const title = 'Portugal HQA Visa Residency Requirements - After Approval';
const metaTitle = `${title} | Portugal HQA Residency`;
const metaDescription =
  'Portugal HQA visa residency requirements are the 2026 stay tests after approval: activity, absences, and registered address, before you plan a card renewal.';
---

<Layout title={metaTitle} description={metaDescription}>
  <article>
    <header>
      <HeroBanner
        image="/images/portugal-hqa-visa-residency-requirements-apartment.jpg"
        alt="Praça do Comércio in Lisbon, with yellow arcades and a white riverside palace facing the Tagus"
        title={title}
        items={[
          { href: '/', label: 'Home' },
          { href: '/portugal-hqa-visa', label: 'Portugal HQA Visa' },
          { href: '/portugal-hqa-visa-requirements', label: 'Requirements' },
          { label: 'After approval' },
        ]}
      />
      <div class="bg-background">
        <div class="site-container py-24 md:py-32">
        <p class="max-w-3xl">
          Portugal HQA visa residency requirements are the obligations that apply after highly qualified activity residence is granted. They are not a second copy of who qualified, and they are not the filing checklist. Admission tests live on
          <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-eligibility" class="inline-link">HQA visa eligibility</a>.
          This page covers staying inside the permit until the next card event, which is usually a
          <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-renewal" class="inline-link">HQA visa renewal</a>.
        </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-background-alt">
      <div class="site-container max-w-3xl py-24 md:py-32">
        <section>
          <h2>Staying within the permit</h2>
          <p class="mt-6">
            The card is issued for a stated activity with a stated host relationship. Changing employer, dropping the highly qualified role, or remaining in Portugal with no qualifying activity can put the permit outside its basis. Tax registration, social security, and a lawful Portuguese address often follow from actually living and working here. Those are not optional branding. Confirm current AIMA practice for host changes before you assume a new contract is a continuation of the same file.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-24">
          <h2>Absences and address</h2>
          <p class="mt-6">
            Residence permits are built for residence in Portugal, not for an unused card in a drawer. Prolonged absence can affect renewal and later
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-permanent-residency" class="inline-link">permanent residency</a>.
            The exact day counts sit in the statute and in AIMA practice in force in 2026; do not copy a number from an old blog post. Keep the registered address current. Mail and official notices follow that address.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4">
            Travel inside Schengen on a Portuguese residence card is not the same as living abroad. If the household will spend most of the year outside Portugal, this route may be the wrong structure. That is a stay question, not an eligibility question.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-24">
          <h2>When renewal becomes the next file</h2>
          <p class="mt-6">
            Toward the end of the card’s validity, the live file is renewal: continued activity, absences, and updated evidence. Permanent residence and citizenship are later, separate statutes. Do not treat this page as a naturalization guide. For the cluster map, return to
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-requirements" class="inline-link">HQA visa requirements</a>.
            For the program, including family cards issued after arrival, use the
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa" class="inline-link">Portugal HQA visa</a>
            guide. Document categories for a first filing remain on
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-documents" class="inline-link">HQA visa documents</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <RequirementsClusterNav current="/portugal-hqa-visa-residency-requirements" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="bg-cta-tint">
      <div class="site-container flex flex-col items-start gap-6 py-24 md:py-32">
        <h2 class="max-w-3xl">Keep the activity, the absences, and the address aligned with the card</h2>
        <p class="max-w-2xl">
          This page is informational. It is not legal, tax, or immigration advice. Stay rules and renewal clocks change. A licensed professional should read your travel pattern and host situation against the current statute.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-cta">Discuss stay obligations after approval</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
